      "description": "One fact in full. Call get_context before answering a question about company data. Read one item you may see, by its id: its text, its sources with the sentence each one gives, who checked it and when, its not_to_conclude line and its outgoing links, plus a page of the items that link to it. An edition needs a service token with edition scope. A link proves neither that an item applies nor a cause.",
